<title>NIGERIA: Premium up at Nigeria's AIICO insurance.</title>
<headline>Premium up at Nigeria's AIICO insurance.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for Nigeria's AIICO Insurance Company to end-June. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				   1996	1995</p>
<p>Gross premium		   379   vs 261.3</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	 22.2 vs  15.4</p>
<p>Taxation			    2.2 vs   3.9</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	  20   vs  11.5</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
